        'When scanned by a smartphone camera, handheld industrial 2D barcode imager, or inventory scanner, the device decodes the byte array and immediately displays the plain text on screen or transmits it via keyboard emulation (HID) to connected software, without opening a web browser or requiring cellular or WiFi connectivity.',
